      en: ["A major road bridge over the capital's most important river.", "Connects the historic center with the northern districts.", "The Rio Água Grande river is approximately 11 kilometers long.", "The bridge was reinforced following severe floods in 1999.", "A popular spot for locals to go fishing at the river's mouth.", "A critical point for rainwater drainage during the wet season."],
